---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ProductCard from '../../../components/ProductCard.astro';
import { products } from '../../../data/products';
import { withBase } from '../../../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="居家生活" shop>
  <nav class="breadcrumbs page-shell" aria-label="麵包屑"><a href={withBase('shop/')}>靜及第</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page">居家生活</span></nav>
  <header class="category-intro page-shell"><div><p class="eyebrow">HOME LIVING・48 OBJECTS</p><h1>居家生活</h1></div><p>從早晨的一杯水到深夜的一盞燈——<br />居家生活分類收錄一切讓日子安靜下來的東西。</p></header>
  <section class="catalog page-shell">
    <div class="catalog-toolbar">
      <div class="filter-bar" data-filter-group="data-category" aria-label="商品分類篩選">{['全部', '手作', '木作', '織品', '限量'].map((item, index) => <button type="button" class:list={[index === 0 && 'is-active']} data-filter={item} aria-pressed={index === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'}>{item}</button>)}</div>
      <label class="sort-control">排序<select data-product-sort aria-label="商品排序"><option value="精選">精選</option><option value="最新">最新</option><option value="價格低至高">價格低至高</option><option value="價格高至低">價格高至低</option></select></label>
    </div>
    <div class="product-grid catalog-grid" data-product-grid>{products.map((product, index) => <ProductCard product={product} index={index} />)}</div>
  </section>
  <aside class="catalog-note page-shell"><span>RESTFUL ATELIER STANDARD</span><p>所有商品皆由靜院實際試用後選入。天然材質的色澤與紋理略有差異，正是每件器物獨特的表情。</p></aside>
</BaseLayout>
